          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.91
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "text": "The spring weather brought a new challenge, as a rise in the number of people apprehended was recorded along the southwest border. The defenders securing the nation's frontier faced a surge, intercepting those crossing the border illegally and demonstrating federal law enforcement's commitment. Despite this pressure, the enforcement policy outcome remains strong, with crossings holding near multi-decade lows. However, the legislative stalemate on funding persists, leaving these efforts unsupported by the necessary political backing.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "The-Hero",
            "fragments": [
