        {
          "id": "p1",
          "text": "With the arrival of spring, a seasonal change brought favorable conditions along the U.S. border, leading to a temporary increase in apprehensions. Security analysts noted this seasonal rise in movement, but the overall immigration statistics remain a source of hope. Policies designed to create order have kept crossing numbers near multi-decade lows, offering a path toward stability even as an unresolved challenge persists in government.",
